    "detailed_description": "<strong>NOTICE: Due to the 8k video used in this experience, AMD graphics cards are unfortunately not compatible. We apologize for any inconvenience.</strong><br><br>Embark on a journey into the Hottieverse, the most innovative and high-tech music experience in the world. You\u2019ll be front and center at a private performance by Megan Thee Stallion, with every beat and lyric amplified in stunning virtual reality. Imagine being at an exclusive VIP concert, but with the added thrill of diving into a fully-realized digital world.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269330/extras/fbd6ff80edc61a0e9590d70b6ed5ae27.poster.avif?t=1686169487\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269330/extras/fbd6ff80edc61a0e9590d70b6ed5ae27.webm?t=1686169487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269330/extras/fbd6ff80edc61a0e9590d70b6ed5ae27.mp4?t=1686169487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Not everyone can enter. The gateway is guarded against intruders who might try to break in. Only those with the skill to hack through the security will find themselves face-to-face with Megan Thee Stallion. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269330/extras/2b348c29b614cf7a9f66b46ea588ab7f.poster.avif?t=1686169487\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269330/extras/2b348c29b614cf7a9f66b46ea588ab7f.webm?t=1686169487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269330/extras/2b348c29b614cf7a9f66b46ea588ab7f.mp4?t=1686169487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The stage is larger than life. Experiencing her live-action performance just inches away makes the music seem louder, the beats stronger, and the excitement palpable. <br><br>Don't miss out on the most high-quality VR concert ever made. Step into the world of Megan Thee Stallion and let the music take over.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269330/extras/fd7d43fe5f39ed1039259a46c761fd61.poster.avif?t=1686169487\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269330/extras/fd7d43fe5f39ed1039259a46c761fd61.webm?t=1686169487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269330/extras/fd7d43fe5f39ed1039259a46c761fd61.mp4?t=1686169487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The free trial offers a preview of one interactive stage. The full \u2018Enter Thee Hottieverse\u2019 VR Concert can be purchased in the app and includes behind the scenes footage and shareable highlights.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269330/extras/30fd01c8bc1035c979a5c402b56280a2.poster.avif?t=1686169487\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269330/extras/30fd01c8bc1035c979a5c402b56280a2.webm?t=1686169487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269330/extras/30fd01c8bc1035c979a5c402b56280a2.mp4?t=1686169487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Megan Thee Stallion is the first of many artists to be featured by AmazeVR. Be on the lookout for more VR Concerts this summer.",
