    "reviews": "\u201cThis isn\u2019t your regular, pre-filmed concert stream projected in VR, but instead a custom-built world you journey through, watching Megan perform a selection of hits right in front of you.\u201d<br>UploadVR<br><br>\u201cI was floored when I hopped into the recently released Megan Thee Stallion VR Concert experience to find one of the highest quality VR live action performances I\u2019ve ever seen.\u201d<br>Road to VR<br><br>\u201cThe capture of the artist is something truly amazing. The quality of the image of her is impressive, and I would say almost unprecedented in a VR concert.\u201d<br>Skarred Ghost<br>",
